  "description": "When a devastating fire wipes out a noble family, a broke and desperate former maid seizes the ultimate chance to steal a wealthy identity. Now living the high life as Lady Rosaline Thesis, she thinks she's finally beaten the system. That is, until a suspicious detective starts investigating the blaze—and seems entirely too interested in uncovering her true colors. Can she keep up the biggest lie of her life without getting burned?\n\n[Original webtoon](https://m.comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=856192)",
